### 2. HIDDEN GLOBALS (`.ws` parse path — S2 relevance)

#### Symbols touched that are **not** instance-private on `WorldSnapshotReaderWriter`

| Symbol | Use in parse | Thread-safe read? |
|--------|--------------|-------------------|
| **`Crc::calculate`** | OTNL `:882` | Read-only `crctable` (`Crc.cpp:23-57`) |
| **`MemoryBlockManager` (Node pool)** | Every `new Node` | Main-thread assumed |
| **`ms_detailLevelBias`** | Not parse; **`setRadius`** in `_DEBUG` uses `ms_overrideUpdateRadius` (`:180-184`) | Written via config at install |
| **`ms_loadSingleNetworkId`** (`_DEBUG`) | Filters NODS inserts `:863-868` | Debug only |
| **`DuplicateString` / `new char[]`** | OTNL via `iff.read_string()` (`Iff.cpp:1602-1608`) | Heap allocator |
| **`TreeFile::open`** | Iff open | Cache mutation; see AsynchronousLoader precedent |
| **`ConfigSharedFile::getValidateIff()`** | Iff open | Config read |
| **`LocalMachineOptionManager`** | Node::install only | N/A at parse time |

**`Node::load` / `load_0000` (`:395-505`)** — no engine globals beyond Iff reads and `new Node`; only `Crc::calculate` in OTNL phase.

#### Buildout half (not `.ws`, but same `load()` body) — S2 blockers

| Symbol | Where |
|--------|-------|
| **`ObjectTemplateList::lookUp`** | `WorldSnapshot.cpp:557`, `:649` |
| **`SharedBuildoutAreaManager::load` / static scene state** | `:456-457`, `SharedBuildoutAreaManager.cpp:292-308` |
| **`DataTable::load(iff)`** | `:474-475` per area |
| **`ConfigClientGame::getLoadBuildoutOnly()`** | `:442` |

